WEBVTT

00:03:59.749 --> 00:04:03.362
I count seven cars and 18 cops
on the corner now,

00:04:03.386 --> 00:04:06.392
a pride around a pound of flesh.

00:04:06.777 --> 00:04:09.721
By the grace of God,
I'm not fed to the beast today.

00:04:10.412 --> 00:04:13.409
Magnanimously, the first cop
makes sure to give me a ticket

00:04:13.433 --> 00:04:14.761
for parking in a bus zone,

00:04:14.785 --> 00:04:16.003
before he sets me free.

00:04:17.076 --> 00:04:18.854
The boy is 16.

00:04:19.573 --> 00:04:22.481
He has a license to drive
in the hollow city,

00:04:22.505 --> 00:04:24.404
enough body to fill my shoes.

00:04:24.428 --> 00:04:26.535
I have grey in my beard,

00:04:26.559 --> 00:04:28.422
and it tells the truth.

00:04:28.446 --> 00:04:32.066
He can navigate traffic
in the age of autonomous vehicles.